Files: decus/*
Copyright: 1973, Walter Bilofsky, Yale University
Comment: DECUS program 10-198a, IMP72 compiler version 1.5, from the DECUS
 library tape 10-LIB-3 as kept by the PDP-10 archive, which states that the
 software was put into the public domain at the time of donation and that its
 use and distribution is completely unrestricted.  The language is by Ned
 Irons.  The three PDP-10 binaries of the tape are not in the Debian source
 package.
